    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Notice:</strong> Achievements are not working right now. Just know that I'm trying to get it working again but it may not work for some time, if ever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2>This game is about a Square, named Norm. Norm has been a Square his entire life and he's begun to tire of it. <br><br>So Norm has a brilliant idea! He'll stop being a Square and become a Circle! It's not as easy as it sounds, though...<br><br>Norm will need to <strong>GAIN SIDES</strong> to become <strong>ROUNDER</strong>. You must guide Norm from <strong>WORLD TO WORLD</strong>, and <strong>BOSS TO BOSS</strong>, gaining SIDES along the way! <br><br>With each boss Norm defeats, a <strong>NEW SIDE</strong> will be added to his shape, and with it, a <strong>NEW POWER</strong>!<br><br>Well... what are you waiting for? LET'S GET GOING!!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><br>Square Norm is a fairly challenging 2d platformer. It starts off easy so you can learn the basics, but quickly ramps up in difficulty later on. If you're looking for a real challenge then look no further!<br><br>You move left and right and can JUMP, as well as perform special ACTIONS depending on your shape.<br><br>There are ENEMIES to defeat, GAPS to jump over, and special hidden STARS in every stage that will unlock HATS and BOSSES.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONTROLS</strong></h2><br>JUMP/ACCEPT - Z<br>ACTION/CANCEL - X<br>MENU - Enter<br>LEFT - Left Arrow<br>RIGHT - Right Arrow<br>UP - Up Arrow<br>DOWN - Down Arrow<br><br>These are the default controls can be changed in the Options.<br>There is gamepad support. Connecting a controller for the first time will prompt you to change the configuration.<br><br><br><br>Thank you for checking out my game! I hope that you decide to try it out!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Notice:</strong> Achievements are not working right now. Just know that I'm trying to get it working again but it may not work for some time, if ever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2>This game is about a Square, named Norm. Norm has been a Square his entire life and he's begun to tire of it. <br><br>So Norm has a brilliant idea! He'll stop being a Square and become a Circle! It's not as easy as it sounds, though...<br><br>Norm will need to <strong>GAIN SIDES</strong> to become <strong>ROUNDER</strong>. You must guide Norm from <strong>WORLD TO WORLD</strong>, and <strong>BOSS TO BOSS</strong>, gaining SIDES along the way! <br><br>With each boss Norm defeats, a <strong>NEW SIDE</strong> will be added to his shape, and with it, a <strong>NEW POWER</strong>!<br><br>Well... what are you waiting for? LET'S GET GOING!!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><br>Square Norm is a fairly challenging 2d platformer. It starts off easy so you can learn the basics, but quickly ramps up in difficulty later on. If you're looking for a real challenge then look no further!<br><br>You move left and right and can JUMP, as well as perform special ACTIONS depending on your shape.<br><br>There are ENEMIES to defeat, GAPS to jump over, and special hidden STARS in every stage that will unlock HATS and BOSSES.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONTROLS</strong></h2><br>JUMP/ACCEPT - Z<br>ACTION/CANCEL - X<br>MENU - Enter<br>LEFT - Left Arrow<br>RIGHT - Right Arrow<br>UP - Up Arrow<br>DOWN - Down Arrow<br><br>These are the default controls can be changed in the Options.<br>There is gamepad support. Connecting a controller for the first time will prompt you to change the configuration.<br><br><br><br>Thank you for checking out my game! I hope that you decide to try it out!",
    "short_description": "Stop being a SQUARE! Become a CIRCLE! Norm needs to GAIN SIDES to become ROUNDER. Guide Norm from WORLD TO WORLD, and BOSS TO BOSS, gaining SIDES along the way! Every boss Norm defeats will grant him a NEW SIDE to his shape, with NEW POWER!",
